      "html": "† <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּה</span></big>  <strong>substantivo feminino. murmúrio, difamação, má notícia (</strong>? como aquilo que desliza furtivamente<strong>)</strong>—absoluto <span dir=\"rtl\">ד׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nm 14.36</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.18\">Pv 10.18</a>; construto <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבַּת</span> <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Jr 20.10</a> + 4 vezes; com sufixo <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּֽתְךָ</span> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.10\">Pv 25.10</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">דִּבָּתָם</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">Gn 37.2</a>;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>murmúrio</em> <a data-ref=\"Psalms 31:14\" href=\"/Psalms.31.14\">Sl 31.14</a>; <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 20:10\" href=\"/Jeremiah.20.10\">Jr 20.10</a> (Hi Hup De Gf VB; contudo cf. Che ψ)<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>difamação</em> <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 10:18\" href=\"/Proverbs.10.18\">Pv 10.18</a> (com <span dir=\"rtl\">הוציא</span>).<br><strong>3.</strong>  <em>má notícia</em>, especificamente um relato (verdadeiro) de má conduta <a data-ref=\"Genesis 37:2\" href=\"/Genesis.37.2\">Gn 37.2</a> (P) <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיָּבֵא אֶת־דִּבָּתָם רָעָה</span>; cf. também <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 25:10\" href=\"/Proverbs.25.10\">Pv 25.10</a> e <a data-ref=\"Ezekiel 36:3\" href=\"/Ezekiel.36.3\">Ez 36.3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">וַתֵּֽעֲלוּ עַל־שְׂפֵת לָשׁוֹן וְדִבַּת־עָ֑ם</span>. Relato desfavorável dos espias <a data-ref=\"Numbers 13:32\" href=\"/Numbers.13.32\">Nm 13.32</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:36\" href=\"/Numbers.14.36\">Nm 14.36</a>, <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">Nm 14.37</a> (todos P e todos com <span dir=\"rtl\">תוֹצִיא</span>; adjetivo <span dir=\"rtl\">רעה</span> somente <a data-ref=\"Numbers 14:37\" href=\"/Numbers.14.37\">Nm 14.37</a>).",
