      "html": "† II. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִיר</span></big> <strong>1.</strong>  <strong> nome próprio masculino.</strong> rei de Eglom <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:3\" href=\"/Joshua.10.3\">Js 10.3</a>.<br><strong>2.</strong>  <strong> nome próprio de lugar. </strong> <strong>a.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִ֫רָה</span> com <span dir=\"rtl\">ָה</span> locativo, fronteira setentrional de Judá <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:7\" href=\"/Joshua.15.7\">Js 15.7</a> (<em>para oeste</em> Hup <a data-ref=\"Psalms 28:2\" href=\"/Psalms.28.2\">Sl 28.2</a>). <strong>b.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">לִדְבִר</span> cidade dos gaditas <a data-ref=\"Joshua 13:26\" href=\"/Joshua.13.26\">Js 13.26</a>, talvez <em>Lôdebâr</em> <a data-ref=\"II Samuel 9:4\" href=\"/II_Samuel.9.4\">2Sm 9.4</a> ver <a data-ref=\"BDB, לֹא דְבָר\" href=\"/BDB,_לֹא דְבָר\" dir=\"rtl\">לֹא דְבָר</a> Di MV. <strong>c.</strong>  <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִיר</span> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:11\" href=\"/Judges.1.11\">Jz 1.11</a><sup>(×2)</sup> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.43\">1Cr 6.43</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִרָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:38\" href=\"/Joshua.10.38\">Js 10.38</a>, <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:39\" href=\"/Joshua.10.39\">Js 10.39</a>, nos demais lugares <span dir=\"rtl\">דְּבִר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:15\" href=\"/Joshua.15.15\">Js 15.15</a> +, cidade real dos cananeus antigamente chamada <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת סֵפֶר</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:15\" href=\"/Joshua.15.15\">Js 15.15</a> <a data-ref=\"Judges 1:11\" href=\"/Judges.1.11\">Jz 1.11</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">קִרְיַת סַנָּה</span> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:49\" href=\"/Joshua.15.49\">Js 15.49</a>; nos montes de Judá, na região de Hebrom <a data-ref=\"Joshua 11:21\" href=\"/Joshua.11.21\">Js 11.21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 15:49\" href=\"/Joshua.15.49\">Js 15.49</a>, atribuída aos sacerdotes aarônicos <a data-ref=\"Joshua 21:15\" href=\"/Joshua.21.15\">Js 21.15</a> como cidade de refúgio <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 6:43\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.6.43\">1Cr 6.43</a>; a moderna <em>Dhoherîye</em>, a 5 horas a sudoeste de Hebrom, segundo Kn, assim Survey<sup>iii. 402</sup>; outras conjecturas em Di <a data-ref=\"Joshua 10:39\" href=\"/Joshua.10.39\">Js 10.39</a> Ri<sup>HWB 265</sup>.",
